@startuml
' Extended SMRT Workflow for "headless TMS"
!theme ihe-ro from ./themes
title Extended SMRT Workflow for "headless TMS"
hide footbox

participant ROIS
participant TMS
participant OST

== Patient Registration ==
ROIS -> TMS : Patient Identity Management [ITI-30]
ROIS -> TMS : Patient Encounter Management [ITI-31]
ROIS -> TMS : Send Patient Photo [FHIR Message]
...
ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Schedule Appointments

loop For each appointment
  ||10||
  ROIS -> TMS : Appointment Notification [RAD-48]
  ||10||
end
...
== Treatment Planning ==
ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Create, Review, Approve Treatment Plan
ROIS -> OST : Publish Approved Planning Artifacts [DICOM]
...
== Treatment Delivery Preparation ==
ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Enrich Plan for Delivery
ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Prepare Sessions,\nAssign Plan Fractions to Scheduled Appointments
ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Approve treatment
ROIS -> OST : Store Deliverable Plan Artifacts [DICOM]
ROIS -> TMS : Report Deliverable Plan Artifact Ready [FHIR Message]
ROIS -> TMS : Appointment-to-Plan/Fraction Assignments [FHIR Message]
note right of ROIS : Each assignment identifies the appointment,\napproved plan and fraction number.
TMS -> OST : Retrieve Deliverable Plan Artifact [DICOM]
TMS -[#a8a8a8]> TMS : Prepare Delivery Sessions from Assignments (no user interaction)
...
== Treatment Delivery ==
loop For each treatment session
...
  ROIS -> TMS : Patient Check-in Appointment Notification [RAD-48]
  note right of ROIS : SIU^S13 - Reschedule Bookings
...
  TMS -[#a8a8a8]> TMS : Manage Treatment Session Delivery
  TMS -> ROIS : Report Delivery Artifacts Ready [FHIR Message]
  ROIS -> OST : Retrieve Delivery Artifacts [DICOM]
  ...
  ROIS -[#a8a8a8]> ROIS : Track Treatment Progress
  ||10||
end

@enduml
